 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Six rules. One town.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.793,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Break one, and the",
   "start": 1.793,
   "end": 3.137,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "town breaks you.",
   "start": 3.137,
   "end": 4.332,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "In this town, you",
   "start": 5.132,
   "end": 6.349,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "carry an umbrella. Even",
   "start": 6.349,
   "end": 7.996,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "when the sun is",
   "start": 7.996,
   "end": 9.07,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "out.",
   "start": 9.07,
   "end": 9.356,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because the rain here\u2026",
   "start": 9.756,
   "end": 11.482,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "only falls on one",
   "start": 11.482,
   "end": 12.817,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "person at a time.",
   "start": 12.817,
   "end": 14.151,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Lena forgot hers once.",
   "start": 15.051,
   "end": 17.44,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "By the time she",
   "start": 17.94,
   "end": 19.019,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "got home\u2026 there was",
   "start": 19.019,
   "end": 20.385,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "nothing left to dry.",
   "start": 20.385,
   "end": 21.823,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "In this town, the",
   "start": 23.323,
   "end": 24.588,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "market will trade you",
   "start": 24.588,
   "end": 26.151,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "anything.",
   "start": 26.151,
   "end": 26.821,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A toy. A memory.",
   "start": 27.221,
   "end": 28.546,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A name. The shopkeeper",
   "start": 28.546,
   "end": 30.367,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "only smiles.",
   "start": 30.367,
   "end": 31.36,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'll trade my name",
   "start": 32.26,
   "end": 33.496,
   "spk": "G"
  },
  {
   "text": "for that doll.",
   "start": 33.496,
   "end": 34.457,
   "spk": "G"
  },
  {
   "text": "She got the doll.",
   "start": 34.957,
   "end": 36.197,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now no one remembers",
   "start": 36.197,
   "end": 37.655,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "she was ever here.",
   "start": 37.655,
   "end": 38.968,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "In this town, your",
   "start": 40.468,
   "end": 41.633,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "cake doesn't count the",
   "start": 41.633,
   "end": 43.057,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "years you've lived.",
   "start": 43.057,
   "end": 44.287,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It counts the years",
   "start": 44.687,
   "end": 46.21,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "you have left.",
   "start": 46.21,
   "end": 47.332,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Noah turned ten. His",
   "start": 48.568,
   "end": 50.339,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "cake had one candle.",
   "start": 50.339,
   "end": 52.109,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mom\u2026 why is there",
   "start": 52.609,
   "end": 53.851,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "only one?",
   "start": 53.851,
   "end": 54.508,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "In this town, you",
   "start": 56.008,
   "end": 57.142,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "can plant anything. But",
   "start": 57.142,
   "end": 58.676,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "it never grows what",
   "start": 58.676,
   "end": 59.944,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "you planted.",
   "start": 59.944,
   "end": 60.744,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It grows\u2026 what you're",
   "start": 61.144,
   "end": 62.893,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "afraid of.",
   "start": 62.893,
   "end": 63.725,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A boy planted tomatoes",
   "start": 64.625,
   "end": 66.363,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "to prove he wasn't",
   "start": 66.363,
   "end": 67.784,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "scared.",
   "start": 67.784,
   "end": 68.337,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The next morning, the",
   "start": 68.837,
   "end": 70.364,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "whole field was watching",
   "start": 70.364,
   "end": 72.109,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "him.",
   "start": 72.109,
   "end": 72.4,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "In this town, there's",
   "start": 73.9,
   "end": 75.509,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "one house nobody walks",
   "start": 75.509,
   "end": 77.196,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "past twice.",
   "start": 77.196,
   "end": 78.039,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Last week\u2026 a new",
   "start": 78.439,
   "end": 79.943,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "family moved in.",
   "start": 79.943,
   "end": 81.447,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every night, another welcome",
   "start": 82.347,
   "end": 84.467,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "mat appears at the",
   "start": 84.467,
   "end": 85.829,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "door.",
   "start": 85.829,
   "end": 86.208,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "We didn't buy those.",
   "start": 86.708,
   "end": 88.607,
   "spk": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one has a",
   "start": 88.907,
   "end": 89.991,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "different family's name.",
   "start": 89.991,
   "end": 91.851,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the last rule.",
   "start": 93.351,
   "end": 94.569,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "When the siren rings,",
   "start": 94.569,
   "end": 95.99,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "you hide. You do",
   "start": 95.99,
   "end": 97.072,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "not look.",
   "start": 97.072,
   "end": 97.681,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's just the wind,",
   "start": 98.081,
   "end": 99.216,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "sweetheart.",
   "start": 99.216,
   "end": 99.873,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "But the siren rang",
   "start": 101.951,
   "end": 103.522,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "three days ago.",
   "start": 103.522,
   "end": 104.831,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And Mom\u2026 has been",
   "start": 105.331,
   "end": 106.626,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "smiling at the window",
   "start": 106.626,
   "end": 108.226,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "ever since.",
   "start": 108.226,
   "end": 109.064,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "She hasn't blinked once.",
   "start": 109.464,
   "end": 111.512,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Six rules. Which one",
   "start": 113.612,
   "end": 115.146,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "would you break first?",
   "start": 115.146,
   "end": 116.833,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
